# Test arena scenes (game/maps/test_arena.tscn).

=== arena_intro ===
@bg crossroads_field
@music march_light
@show TELLEN left smirk
@show SABLE right neutral
TELLEN (smirk): A crossroads, a river and a fort full of people who don't like us.
SABLE: You say that like it's a good thing.
TELLEN: It's a busy thing. Busy is profitable.
@show GID center angry
GID (angry): Less talking. More axes.
@end

=== arena_boss ===
@show TELLEN left neutral
@show DUELIST right angry
TELLEN: You're the one running this fort?
DUELIST (angry): I'm the one who'll be running you through.
@end

=== arena_talk_hexcaller ===
@show TELLEN left smirk
@show HEXCALLER right neutral
TELLEN (smirk): Your friends left you on the wrong side of the river.
HEXCALLER: ...And you're offering a better side?
@choice
- "Better pay, too." -> pay
- "Better company." -> company

@label pay
@set map.hexcaller_paid = true
HEXCALLER: Coin talks. I'm listening.
@goto join

@label company
@show SABLE center happy
SABLE (happy): He means me.

@label join
HEXCALLER: Fine. I'm with you.
@end

=== arena_village ===
@bg village_square
@show TELLEN center neutral
ELDER: Travelers! Take this, and keep those brigands off our road.
@item vulnerary
TELLEN: Much obliged.
@hide_item
@end

=== arena_reinforcements ===
@sfx horn
@show GID center surprised
GID (surprised): More of them, from the east road!
@end

=== arena_victory ===
@show TELLEN left happy
@show SABLE right happy
TELLEN (happy): And that's the crossroads cleared. Drinks are on the fort.
SABLE: The fort is on fire.
TELLEN: Then the drinks are warm.
@end
